dashboard_builder.description:
This screen will create and update iCloud3 Dashboards for tracked devices (up to 4) with different styles and views. The Dashboards can then be customized using the HA Dashboard tools or used as-is.

{db_icons}

{header_msg}

analytics.description:
The iCloud3 Analytics collects version, location (country/region), usage and various counts from the 15,000+ iCloud3 users. It's purpose is to report summary information showing where users are located, what version is being used and various counts (Apple Account, tracked devices, comments, etc.). The data you will send is shown below. Summary reports can be selected on *Reports* screen

Hopefully, you will Enable *Send iCloud3 Analytics Data* below and participate in this project.

{downloads}

